# FREE-FIRST ROUTING (principal 2026-08-26: exploit OpenRouter's free tiers for everything
# possible -- cold audits, insights, reviews, research, mining, survivors, recommendations,
# hunting). Sourced by every LLM organ runner BEFORE it resolves a model.
#
# WHY THIS IS A POLICY FILE AND NOT TWELVE EDITS. libs/ops/llm_route.py already encodes the
# rule -- "a free-tier answer is worth immeasurably more than no answer, and 'the account is
# unfunded' is a reason to route cheaper, never a reason to stop" -- and every organ resolves a
# CHAIN. Flipping the chain order in one sourced file changes all of them at once, and changes
# back the same way, instead of leaving twelve slightly different fixes to drift apart.
#
# IDENTITY IS PRESERVED, NEVER SUBSTITUTED. The DeepSeek flywheel refuses silent identity
# substitution (mandate IV: an unavailable DeepSeek records MODEL_UNAVAILABLE rather than
# quietly serving the request from another brain) -- so its free seats are FREE DEEPSEEK, not
# "whatever is free". The same rule holds for every other identity below: free variant of the
# SAME family, or nothing.
#
# DEGRADATION BUYS ATTEMPTS, NEVER LENIENCY (L1.54 clause 2). Routing cheaper never lowers a
# gate, never retries a refusal, and never papers over an empty answer -- the caller is handed
# the model that actually answered and records it, so any finding stays attributable and
# re-runnable on a paid route later if one is ever funded.

# --- DeepSeek second flywheel: bulk vs deep split, both free ---------------------------------
export DEEPSEEK_BULK_MODEL="deepseek/deepseek-r1:free"
export DEEPSEEK_DEEP_MODEL="deepseek/deepseek-r1:free"

# --- Panel / audit / review: free roster is the DEFAULT roster --------------------------------
# run_external_panel already falls back to llm_panel_free.json when unfunded; this makes the
# free roster the deliberate first choice rather than a consolation prize.
export PANEL_ROSTER_FILE="data/secrets/llm_panel_free.json"
export PANEL_PREFER_FREE=1

# --- Hunters: free variants first in the chain -------------------------------------------------
# kimi_hunter already carries free seats (kimi-k2:free, deepseek-r1:free, qwen3-235b:free) but
# they sat LAST. FREE_FIRST=1 reverses the chain order at resolution time.
export LLM_FREE_FIRST=1
export KIMI_ROUTINE_FREE=1

# --- Hard stop on paid spend unless explicitly overridden --------------------------------------
# An organ that wants a paid route must set ALLOW_PAID=1 for that single invocation, in the open,
# rather than acquiring the habit quietly.
export ALLOW_PAID=0
